            "review_title": "Review at Kamalas Vegan Restaurant And Lounge",
            "review_text": "Hellen\n4 contributions\n0\nAwesome Vegan food. Nice place. Must try\nMar 2022\nMy family had a lovely lunch here and totally recommend the Vegan Restaurant. We order Creamy Panne Pasta, Quinoa fried rice Masala, Oven-baked Eggplant, Fig Salad.. All of them were fresh, tasty. The restaurant does not use refined spices. Good for health and suitable for a macrobiotic diet. Restaurant space is calm, cute, lots of trees\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 21, 2022",
