            "review_text": "Nguyễn N\n1 contribution\n0\nThe Vegan restaurant in Ho Chi Minh city\nNov 2021\nThe Vegan restaurant I like the most out of all the vegetarian restaurants I've been to in Saigon.\nI'm not a religious person or a vegetarian, I just love Vegan or Eat Clean dishes, but the food and drinks here are very tasty and the ingredients are fresh.\nThe space of the restaurant is decorated just right, delicate, I like the garden area of the restaurant the most, green vegetables.\n1 plus point for the staff who know how to observe and support when needed.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2021",
